@startuml Materialized View Refresh Flow
title Materialized View Refresh Flow

!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 50

package "Backend" {
  class MaterializedViewService {
    +refreshMaterializedViews(): Promise<void>
    +createMaterializedViews(): Promise<void>
    +ensureMaterializedViewIndexes(): Promise<void>
  }

  class SchemaInit as "Migrations (database/migrate.ts)" {
    +runMigrations()
  }
}

database "SQLite" as DB {
  node "Summary tables (baseline migration)" as MatViews {
    rectangle "mv_monthly_summary"
    rectangle "mv_category_totals"
  }

  node "Indexes" as Indexes {
    idx_mv_monthly_summary
    idx_mv_category_totals
  }
}

package "External" as External {
  class StartupHook
  class ImportCompletion
}

' Startup refresh
External --> SchemaInit : App startup and migrations
SchemaInit --> External : Express begins listening
External --> MaterializedViewService : Post-listen warmup
MaterializedViewService --> MatViews : fill empty tables (one transaction)
MaterializedViewService --> Indexes : CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS
MaterializedViewService --> MatViews : refill: DELETE + INSERT ... SELECT\n(both tables, one transaction)

MatViews --> DB : refreshed

' Import-triggered refresh
ImportCompletion --> MaterializedViewService : Schedule after reconciliation\nHTTP response does not await
MaterializedViewService --> MatViews : debounced refill

note right of MaterializedViewService
  Views:
  - mv_monthly_summary
  - mv_category_totals
   
  Readers see the last committed
  contents until COMMIT, never an
  empty table mid-refill (ADR-263)
   
  Refreshed on:
  - App startup (after schema init)
  - After import (5s trailing debounce,
    10s burst cap)
  
  Coalesces rapid calls
  (shared in-flight promise plus
   one queued follow-up)
end note

@enduml
